{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>由 à la mode games 開發的 Sorry We’re Closed 正在 Epic Games 平台<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，截止時間為 11 月 3 日 00:00（香港時間）。這款作品主打懷舊單人生存恐怖，結合豐富的故事劇情與角色，並提供多結局探索。</p>\n<p>玩家會以固定視角在充滿詭譎氛圍的場景中探索，透過開啟第三隻眼穿梭兩界，逐步揭開秘密並解開謎題。遊戲流程圍繞生存恐怖與敘事推進，玩家需要留意環境細節，在探索與解謎之間尋找前進線索。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026 10 29 at 4.39.28 PM\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1402\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-29-at-4.39.28-PM.jpg\" width=\"2432\"/><figcaption>Screenshot</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026 10 29 at 4.39.20 PM\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1392\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-29-at-4.39.20-PM.jpg\" width=\"2488\"/><figcaption>Screenshot</figcaption></figure>\n</figure>\n<p>作品採單人遊玩，主打豐富故事劇情與角色描寫，並以多結局設計讓玩家從不同角度探索故事。固定視角與兩界穿梭機制亦強化詭譎氛圍，適合喜歡敘事型恐怖解謎的玩家。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】第三隻眼穿梭兩界 Sorry We\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Sorry-Were-Closed-1rco5.jpg\" width=\"1920\"/></figure>\n<p>遊戲名稱：Sorry We’re Closed<br/>支援平台：Windows<br/>領取位置：<a href=\"https://store.epicgames.com/p/sorry-were-closed-724c86?lang=en-US\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Epic Games</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T16:01:00.904053+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":371,"images":3,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T03:39:54.407971+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:58:28.121173+00:00","content_hash":"6f24f5e705fd285046960135d286dc98a41fb631a4faecfd9721ce8fc96a0e80","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}